      "writtenOn": "2026-04-02T08:57:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I intentionally moved the hook to after the `if (!cma || !cma-\u003ecount || !cma-\u003ebitmap)` check.\nIn the previous version, the hook was placed before this validity check, which meant vendor callbacks could receive a NULL cma pointer or a CMA area with no bitmap/count.\nThat was unsafe if the vendor module dereferenced cma (e.g., to check cma-\u003ename to identify the CMA region).\nMoving it after the validity check ensures the vendor hook always receives a valid, usable CMA area.",
